OL,3,AIsrael marks three years since
OL,4,AHamas-led 7 October 2023 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael launched a military offensive in
OL,7,FGaza in response to the 7 October
OL,8,Fattacks, in which more than 74,200
OL,9,Fpeople have since been killed,
OL,10,Faccording to the Hamas-run health
OL,11,Fministry
OL,13,FIsrael does not allow international
OL,14,Fnews organisations, including the BBC,
OL,15,Finto Gaza to report freely
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
