OL,3,AEx-US spy who stashed gold bars in his
OL,4,Ahome admits to $200m scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former CIA officer who was arrested
OL,7,Fafter authorities found hundreds of
OL,8,Fgold bars stashed in his home has
OL,9,Fadmitted to defrauding the US
OL,10,Fgovernment in a sprawling $200m (#151m)
OL,11,Fscam involving fake contracts and real
OL,12,Festate.
OL,14,FDavid Rush, 49, is required to pay
OL,15,Frestitution to the government and
OL,16,Fforfeit luxury real estate, cars,
OL,17,Fwatches and other assets tied to his
OL,18,Fcrime as part of the plea deal.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
